  message: "ADR-0051 annotation (WI-virav; annotate only -- no fold, no closure, no re-prioritisation). CLAUSE VIOLATED: owner path \"spelled in the source language's import vocabulary\". NOTION THE SLOT CARRIES: namespace -- the WRONG one: the slot holds the parent package (`defusedcsv`) and the submodule that actually owns the symbol (`defusedcsv.csv`) sits in the NAME slot. Pair 3 shape (qualifier in the NAME slot) with the owner path truncated one segment short, which is why neither catalogue spelling can match it."  # b3a3
